title: The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> Is Banned!
subtitle: The Interior Ministry discovers "alarming evidence" of a planned revolution.
view-if: chancellor == "Staal" and dsu_in_gov and not dsu_was_gov and dsu_policy and reichstag_joever_time >= 1 and not collectivist_explode
on-arrival: collectivist_relation = 40 if collectivist_relation < 40
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
priority: -1
tags: event
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/left_wing.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> Is Banned!

Wilhelm Frask of the Interior Ministry has announced an emergency measure, effectively banning the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> after conveniently "uncovering" evidence of a planned revolution involving the <span style="color: #700000;">**RFB**</span>—including several warehouses allegedly stocked with weapons. A raid on a <span style="color: #700000;">**Communist**</span> party office has also produced a so-called plan to establish a new "<span style="color: #750e0e;">Central Union the Commonwealth</span>" in the aftermath of the revolt.

According to the government, these plans were to be set in motion in protest against Staal's unconstitutional adjournment and the mass arrests of <span style="color: #700000;">**Communist**</span> deputies that followed. Only the state's last-minute intervention, they claim, has saved the Commonwealth from violent revolt.

But Staal and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> cannot be trusted. They could just as easily have planted the evidence to manufacture a pretext for crushing the <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span>.

- @kpd_ban

@kpd_ban
title: President DuFour wastes no time signing all requested emergency powers.
on-arrival: {!
Q.collectivist_explode = 1;

Q.staal_marcher_r -= 2;
Q.staal_marcher_influence -= 1;
Q.staal_marcher_support -= 3;
Q.staal_approval -= 1;

Q.pro_republic -= 10;

Q.vanguard_militancy *= 0.8;
Q.vanguard_strength *= 0.6;

Q.commons_marcher += 2;
Q.commons_collectivist -= 6;
Q.commons_sapd -= 4;

Q.burgher_collectivist -= 2;
Q.burgher_sapd -= 2;

Q.disfavored_marcher += 2;
Q.disfavored_collectivist -= 4;
Q.disfavored_sapd -= 4;

Q.collectivist_banned = 1;
Q.sapd_banned = 1;

for (var party of Q.parties) {
    Q[party+'_r_pre'] = Q[party+'_r'];
}

Q.collectivist_r = 0;
Q.sapd_r = 0;

total_r_sum = 0;

for (var party of Q.parties) {
    total_r_sum += Q[party + '_r'];
}

if (total_r_sum !== 100) {
    let normalization_factor = 100 / total_r_sum;
    for (var party of Q.parties) {
        Q[party + '_r'] = Math.round(Q[party + '_r'] * normalization_factor * 10) / 10;
    }
}

if (Q.heartland_leader === "Crowde") {
  Q.vanguard_militancy *= 0.9;
  Q.vanguard_strength *= 0.8;
  Q.commons_collectivist -= 4;
  Q.burgher_collectivist -= 2;
  Q.disfavored_collectivist -= 4;
  Q.commons_sapd -= 2;
  Q.disfavored_sapd -= 2;
}
!}
audio: music/1930_1933/Einheitsfrontlied.mp3

All <span style="color: #700000;">**Communist**</span> Assembly members who haven't fled to the Central Union are arrested and thrown in forced labor camps, working over 14 hours a day to further public works projects, and more problematic <span style="color: #700000;">**RFB**</span> fighters are given the death penalty en masse, being prosecuted by special local courts. 

<span style="color: #700000;">**Communist**</span> party offices are officially closed down, with the Commonwealth Army's militia quickly suppressing any public demonstration or attempted armed uprising against the ban. Local mayors belonging to the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> are removed by force, and replaced with [? if gnu_formed: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>?][? if not gnu_formed: Staal?] loyalists.

[? if heartland_leader == "Crowde": Furthermore, Crowde has authorized an extensive crackdown on suspected <span style="color: #700000;">Communist</span> members using his authority as Minister-President of Heartland, even if said members don't pose a significant threat. ?]

[? if sapd_formed: Along with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, the <span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span> is seen as complicit and has its members persecuted in the same fashion as the former. Are we really going to allow the government to throw our former party members and comrades into prisons? ?][? if not sapd_formed: Are we really going to allow the government to throw our comrades into prisons? ?]

- @do_nothing
- @fight_mild
- @fight

@do_nothing
title: We should be grateful that nothing happened to us!
