- @soviet_union_aid

@soviet_union_aid
title: How will the <span style="color: #750e0e;">Central Union</span> respond?
subtitle: The country ironically funding the Commonwealth Army's secret rearmament.

Despite the <span style="color: #750e0e;">Central Union</span> perhaps being indirectly responsible by training the officers battling their <span style="color: #700000;">**Communist**</span> brethren on the streets, many <span style="color: #750e0e;">Central Union</span> politicians are privately outraged as fleeing <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> politicians spread the news of their party's dissolution.

However, despite this, Halsmark has adhered to his policy of secretly aiding the Commonwealth in its rearmament through officer training and supplying armament technology. Staal's fears have thus subsided for now, with Halsmark having near complete control over his party.

@fight_mild
title: We'll launch peaceful protests and a general strike. Staal can't rule without the people's support. 
subtitle: But he may seize on this as a pretext to escalate the crackdown.
unavailable-subtitle: Staal has too much influence over us.
choose-if: staal_marcher_influence < 6

We are in no position to fight a civil war against the full force of the state, but we cannot let Staal live without consequences. We have an array of options at our disposal, the [? if not unions_independent: ADGB?][? if unions_independent: workers?] can launch a general strike, and use the the Banners as leverage, if we had maintained its strength. Cracking down on the universally hated <span style="color: #700000;">**RFB**</span> is one thing, but a mass <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> movement?

We don't know if Staal will budge. Our former coalition partners and members are skeptical to potentially risk the survival of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> to protest in solidarity with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span>. 

Do we continue to bide our time?

- @fight_mild_2
- @do_nothing: This isn't our fight.

@fight_mild_2
title: The workers stopped the officers’ putsch in 4285.
subtitle: And we can do it again.
on-arrival: {!
Q.staal_points = 0;
Q.marcher_points = 0;

Q.staal_points += Q.commons_staal;
if (Q.unions_independent) Q.staal_points += 5;
Q.staal_points += Q.republicans_staal;
if (Q.gnu_formed) Q.staal_points += Q.gnu_votes / 10;

Q.normalized_commons_total = Q.commons_marcher_normalized;
if (Q.collectivist_relation >= 40) {
    Q.normalized_commons_total += Q.commons_collectivist_normalized;
} else if (Q.collectivist_relation < 40) {
    Q.normalized_commons_total += Q.commons_collectivist_normalized*0.5;
}
Q.marcher_points += ((1 - Q.labor_dissent/100)*Q.normalized_commons_total*(1 - Q.disfavored/100)*2.5) / 5;

Q.banner_power = Q.banner_strength*Q.banner_militancy;
if (Q.dissent > 0.15) {
    Q.banner_power *= (1 - Q.dissent/1.5);
}
Q.marcher_points += Q.banner_power / 50;

Q.heartland_police_power = Q.heartland_police_strength*Q.heartland_police_militancy*Q.heartland_police_loyalty;
Q.evil_heartland_police_power = Q.heartland_police_strength*Q.heartland_police_militancy*(1 - Q.heartland_police_loyalty);
if (Q.marcher_heartland && Q.heartland_leader == "Bristol" || Q.heartland_leader == "Pendrigon") {
    Q.marcher_points += Q.heartland_police_power / 10;
} else if (Q.marcher_heartland && Q.heartland_leader !== "Bristol" && Q.heartland_leader !== "Pendrigon") {
    Q.marcher_points += (Q.heartland_police_power / 20);
}
if (Q.heartland_leader == "Staal" || Q.heartland_leader == "Goodlake" || Q.heartland_leader == "Crowde") {
    Q.staal_points += Q.evil_heartland_police_power / 50;
}
Q.army_power = Q.army_strength*Q.army_militancy;
Q.staal_points += Q.army_power/50;

Q.vanguard_power = Q.vanguard_strength*Q.vanguard_militancy / 50;
if (Q.collectivist_relation >= 40) {
    Q.marcher_points += Q.vanguard_power;
} else if (Q.collectivist_relation < 40) {
    Q.marcher_points += Q.vanguard_power*0.5;
}

Q.enemy_power = 0;
Q.loyalist_power = Q.loyalist_strength*Q.loyalist_militancy / 50;
// adjust if sa is friends with schleicher
Q.enemy_power += Q.loyalist_power;
Q.warden_power = Q.warden_strength*Q.warden_militancy / 50;
Q.enemy_power += Q.warden_power;

Q.staal_points += Q.enemy_power;

if (!Q.dstp_gnu && !Q.lvp_gnu && !Q.dstp_maintained && (Q.republicans_staal < 8 || ((Q.ddp_relation >= 50 && !Q.lvp_formed || Q.lvp_relation >= 60 && Q.lvp_formed) && (Q.lvp_leader != "Dingeldey" && Q.lvp_ideology != "Right" || !Q.lvp_formed))) && (Q.ddp_relation >= 35 && !Q.lvp_formed || Q.lvp_relation >= 45 && Q.lvp_formed) && (Q.lvp_leader != "Dingeldey" && Q.lvp_ideology != "Right" || !Q.lvp_formed)) Q.libs_against_staal = 1;
if ((Q.unionist_ideology == "Left" || Q.stegerwald_path || Q.unionist_relation >= 60) && (Q.republicans_staal < 6 || Q.unionist_relation >= 70) && Q.unionist_leader != "Hughes") Q.unionist_against_staal = 1;

if (Q.unionist_against_staal) Q.marcher_points += 5;
if (Q.unionist_against_staal && Q.unionist_in_gov) Q.marcher_points += 2;
if (Q.libs_against_staal) Q.marcher_points += 3;

if (!Q.unionist_against_staal && !Q.libs_against_staal) Q.marcher_alone = 1;

if (Q.marcher_points > Q.staal_points) {
    Q.marcher_win = 1;
} else if (Q.marcher_points >= (Q.staal_points / 2)) {
    Q.marcher_med = 1;
} else {
    Q.marcher_lose = 1;
}

Q.staal_fight = 1;

!}

