@z_break_gov
on-arrival: dufour_staal_r -= 2; republicans_staal_bonus -= 4; unionist_in_gov = 0; faithful_gnu -= 10; faithful_gnu_bonus -= 8; faithful_unionist -= 4; faithful_traditionalist += 2 if not kvp_formed; faithful_kvp += 2; faithful_gold += 2

= The <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> exits cabinet

With the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> already on the verge of breaking with Staal's cabinet after the unconstitutional adjournment of the chamber, this latest undemocratic act has convinced its leaders that only a united <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> front can restore the Commonwealth to normalcy.

Staal’s presidential cabinet now stands deeply delegitimized and increasingly unpopular in the eyes of the public, effectively ending his hopes of manipulating the party’s internal politics or using them to maintain even a façade of parliamentary democracy going forward.

- @schleicher_cabinet_13_pre

@z_break_oppo
on-arrival: dufour_staal_r -= 1; republicans_staal_bonus -= 2; faithful_gnu -= 6; faithful_gnu_bonus -= 4; faithful_unionist -= 2; faithful_traditionalist += 2 if not kvp_formed; faithful_kvp += 2

= The <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> cuts all ties

The ongoing negotiations to bring the <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> into Staal's cabinet have collapsed entirely, with the party now in full opposition to President DuFour and the government he supports.

- @schleicher_cabinet_13_pre


