@fight
title: Revolt! This is Staal's second step toward dictatorship!
unavailable-subtitle: Staal has too much influence over us.
choose-if: staal_marcher_influence < 4

Staal has no intention of relinquishing power once stability is restored—his paranoia (not entirely unfounded) tells him that the moment we return to office democratically, we’ll undo all the progress made toward rearmament, especially with DuFour not expected to live much longer.

This, combined with his blatant constitutional breach just a week ago, has finally galvanized the remaining <span style="color: #000000;">repu</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">bli</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">cans</span> against the Chancellor.

Perhaps its our time to strike?

- @civil_war: The <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> stands with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span>.
- @fight_mild
- @do_nothing: This isn't our fight.